      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "My story ... ? I have not always been like this. I once had wealth, power, and the love of a beautiful woman. Now, I only have two things. . . My dignity. . . and my pride ."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 793,
        "text": "But things changed, and with all the additions to the family, we had to tear down the old house, even though we loved it and build a bigger one."
      }
